{"id":"a91903f455f49892","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-logspace-reduction.md","title":"Logspace Many-One Reduction","display":"df-logspace-reduction — Logspace Many-One Reduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-logspace-reduction","aliases":["28-df-logspace-reduction"],"display":"df-logspace-reduction — Logspace Many-One Reduction","depends_on":["[[28-df-l]]","[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-logspace-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-logspace-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-logspace-reduction — Logspace Many-One Reduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e145640be927aa76\" href=\"?note=e145640be927aa76\" title=\"28-df-l\">28-df-l</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L\">\\(\\mathbf L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e145640be927aa76\" href=\"?note=e145640be927aa76\" title=\"28-df-l\">28-df-l</a>；对每个候选全函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>，以下定义参数族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_f,D_f\">\\(B_f,D_f\\)</span>；输出比特以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 为起始索引。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(i)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(i)\\)</span> 为正整数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 的无前导零二进制表示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,i\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x,i\\rangle\\)</span> 由下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,i\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,\\operatorname{bin}(i))\\qquad(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*,\\ i\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle x,i\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,\\operatorname{bin}(i))\\qquad(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*,\\ i\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nB_f&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,i\\rangle\\mid x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\land1\\le i\\le|f(x)|\\land f(x)_i=1\\},\\\\\nD_f&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,i\\rangle\\mid x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\land1\\le i\\le|f(x)|\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{FL}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{f:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;|f(x)|\\le c(|x|+2)^a\\land B_f\\in\\mathbf L\\land D_f\\in\\mathbf L\\},\\\\\nA\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}B&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FL}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nB_f&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,i\\rangle\\mid x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\land1\\le i\\le|f(x)|\\land f(x)_i=1\\},\\\\\nD_f&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,i\\rangle\\mid x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\land1\\le i\\le|f(x)|\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{FL}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{f:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;|f(x)|\\le c(|x|+2)^a\\land B_f\\in\\mathbf L\\land D_f\\in\\mathbf L\\},\\\\\nA\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}B&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FL}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>输出可能比对数工作空间大，故采用逐位隐式计算；长度域谓词不可省略，否则只给“为1的位”不能确定输出长度和末尾零。与另有只写向右输出带的对数空间转导机等价。此定义同时被 NL 完全性和 P 完全性稳定复用，原目录无兼容节点，故补建。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定义4.16；印刷88页；PDF114页。两个语言及多项式输出长度条件已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-l","status":"resolved","id":"e145640be927aa76","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-l]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-l","status":"resolved","id":"e145640be927aa76","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf L$ 见 [[28-df-l]]；对每个候选全函数 $f:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*$，以下定义参数族 $B_f,D_f$；输出比特以 $1$ 为起始索引。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]；$\\operatorname{bin}(i)$ 为正整数 $i$ 的无前导零二进制表示，$i\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$\\langle x,i\\rangle$ 由下式定义。$A,B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf L","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"B_f,D_f","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(i)","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,i\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,i\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,\\operatorname{bin}(i))\\qquad(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*,\\ i\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nB_f&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,i\\rangle\\mid x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\land1\\le i\\le|f(x)|\\land f(x)_i=1\\},\\\\\nD_f&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle x,i\\rangle\\mid x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\land1\\le i\\le|f(x)|\\},\\\\\n\\mathbf{FL}&\\coloneqq\\{f:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\\mid\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;|f(x)|\\le c(|x|+2)^a\\land B_f\\in\\mathbf L\\land D_f\\in\\mathbf L\\},\\\\\nA\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}B&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FL}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(x\\in A\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in B).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1861,"backlinks":[{"id":"cc24f2c1587a5632","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*$；$\\mathbf P$ 见 [[28-df-p]]，$\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}$ 见 [[28-df-logspace-reduction]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-206","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"计算模型与空间归约接口：[[28-df-machine-resources]]、[[28-df-logspace-reduction]]、[[28-df-pspace-complete]]、[[28-thm-space-time-relations]]、[[28-thm-logspace-reduction-properties]]。"},{"id":"56dcd157465c8761","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8380a071500296f8","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PATH}$、$\\mathbf{NL}$、$\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}$ 分别见 [[28-df-path]]、[[28-df-nl]]、[[28-df-logspace-reduction]]。"}],"outgoing":["e145640be927aa76","0dfeff4bd5d69b86"]}